      "extract": "The aim of this work is to describe the characters (one-dimensional representations) of the fusion algebra of g = bsl(n)k WZW conformal models at rational (shifted) level κ := k + n = p′/p , for n = 3 = p′ , (p, 3) = 1 and their ‘classical’ counterparts. In [9] we have realised this fusion algebra as a matrix algebra F ⊂Matp2(C) with integer nonnegative structure constants (p)N z y,x and a basis {Ny , (Ny)z x = (p)N",
