      "extract": "We start with ﬁxing some notation. Let ∆, ∆+ , Π = {α1, . . . , αn−1} be, respectively, the sets of roots, positive roots, and the simple roots of g = sl(n), and ∆re , ∆re + = ∆+ ∪(∆+ Z>0 δ) , Π = {α0 = δ −P i αi , Π} , – the set of real roots, real positive roots and the simple roots of the aﬃne algebra g = bsl(n)k. Let Λi be the fundamental weights of g, i.e., ⟨Λi , αj⟩= δij, with respect to the Killing-Cartan",
